// A short token stream for the cursor accessors (par_kind, par_text, par_line,
// par_val, par_frac, par_pth) and the advance/fold helpers: a #file marker (so
// par_pth has a real, non-default path to read), a fractional number, a
// string and an operator. Placed beside advance.id and fold.id, which need it
// too -- par/cur/tok already held three entries.

par_tok_setup() {
  lex_init();
  lex_run("#file game.idml\n3.5 \"hi\" +");
} return void;
():() then lex_kind_len:(4)
():() then lex_kind_len:(4) then eprints:("")
